{"schema_version":"1.9.2","id":"ALSA-2026:103290","published":"2026-11-24T00:00:00Z","modified":"2026-11-26T12:30:02.226819667Z","related":["CVE-2026-19630"],"upstream":["CVE-2026-19630"],"summary":"Low: dhcp security update","details":"The Dynamic Host Configuration Protocol (DHCP) is a protocol that allows individual devices on an IP network to get their own network configuration information, including an IP address, a subnet mask, and a broadcast address. The dhcp packages provide a relay agent and ISC DHCP service required to enable and administer DHCP on a network.  \n\nSecurity Fix(es):  \n\n  * bind: BIND: Denial of Service via unbounded processing of crafted DNS messages (CVE-2026-19630)\n\n\nFor more details about the security issue(s), including the impact, a CVSS score, acknowledgments, and other related information, refer to the CVE page(s) listed in the References section.\n","affected":[{"package":{"name":"dhcp-client","ecosystem":"AlmaLinux:9","purl":"pkg:rpm/almalinux/dhcp-client"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"12:4.4.2-22.b1.el9_9.1"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/AlmaLinux/osv-database/blob/master/advisories/almalinux9/ALSA-2026:103290.json"}},{"package":{"name":"dhcp-common","ecosystem":"AlmaLinux:9","purl":"pkg:rpm/almalinux/dhcp-common"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"12:4.4.2-22.b1.el9_9.1"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/AlmaLinux/osv-database/blob/master/advisories/almalinux9/ALSA-2026:103290.json"}},{"package":{"name":"dhcp-relay","ecosystem":"AlmaLinux:9","purl":"pkg:rpm/almalinux/dhcp-relay"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"12:4.4.2-22.b1.el9_9.1"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/AlmaLinux/osv-database/blob/master/advisories/almalinux9/ALSA-2026:103290.json"}},{"package":{"name":"dhcp-server","ecosystem":"AlmaLinux:9","purl":"pkg:rpm/almalinux/dhcp-server"},"rang